        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-MELROSE-MB\"><b>Laurey Melrose Matte Black Cabinet Bar Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Melrose Matte Black Cabinet Bar Pull is a great addition to any modern kitchen. The sleek, simple lines of these slim cabinet pull make it modern and the Matte Black color finishes the look. The Matte Black Melrose Cabinet Pull comes packaged with mounting hardware. Choose from a few different lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Melrose Matte Black Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-87020:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87120:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87220:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87320:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-87420:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
